"""Fresh V2 history-conditioning isolation runner.

This module is intentionally safe to import with the Python standard library
only.  It contains identity, intervention construction, bounded orchestration,
evidence, and finite-cohort accounting.  Model, Torch, Cognee, evaluator, and
Angler runtime imports are confined to explicitly called construction/live
boundaries.

The experiment is local synthetic exploratory evidence.  Its records are
leaf-local and non-authorizing; they are not approved Action, Feedback,
Episode, PlasticState, EvaluationReceipt, PromotionDecision, or prospective
authorization contracts.
"""

